        "title": {
          "en": "OpenAI Enhances Agents SDK with Sandbox Execution, Model-Native Harness",
          "zh": "OpenAI 升级 Agents SDK，引入沙箱执行和模型原生线束"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "OpenAI has updated its Agents SDK to include native sandbox execution and a model-native harness, designed to help developers build secure, long-running agents.",
          "zh": "OpenAI 更新了其 Agents SDK，增加了原生沙箱执行和模型原生线束功能，旨在帮助开发者构建安全的、长时间运行的智能体。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "The Agents SDK now features native sandbox execution for enhanced security.",
            "A new model-native harness supports the development of long-running agents.",
            "Agents can operate securely across various files and tools within the updated SDK."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "该 Agents SDK 现已具备原生沙箱执行功能，以增强安全性。",
            "新增的模型原生线束支持开发长时间运行的智能体。",
            "在更新后的 SDK 中，智能体能够安全地跨文件和工具进行操作。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This update provides developers with tools for more robust and secure AI agent development. It addresses challenges related to agent longevity and operational safety across diverse environments.",
          "zh": "此次更新为开发者提供了更强大、更安全的 AI 智能体开发工具。它解决了智能体长期运行和在多样化环境中操作安全性的相关挑战。"
        },
        "source": "OpenAI News",
        "link": "https://openai.com/index/the-next-evolution-of-the-agents-sdk"
